recipe.prompt:
Use case: object atlas for a side-view pixel-art platformer in a giant mossy tree.
Subject, one object per cell:
arrow = plain wooden arrow with iron tip and green fletching, horizontal pointing right;
footing_arrow = wooden arrow with glowing teal leaf-shaped tip and teal fletching, horizontal pointing right;
thorn_shot = a sharp red-and-green thorn projectile pointing right;
mud_ball = round brown mud glob with drips;
stag_seed = glowing teal seed pod projectile;
heart_pickup = small red heart-shaped berry with a leaf;
energy_stone = teal crystal stone with glowing rune;
dash_relic = feathered green wind charm amulet with swirl symbol, glowing;
footing_relic = carved wooden quiver relic with teal glowing leaf arrows;
heart_relic = large golden-framed red heart crystal;
golden_feather = shining golden arrow feather;
thorn_spikes = a row of sharp dark red thorny root spikes pointing up, wide and short, flat base;
root_lift = a wooden lift platform of planks bound by roots with two ropes going up, wide;
villager = friendly old villager elder with walking stick, green robe and leaf hat, side view facing right;
lantern = hanging amber paper lantern on a short chain;
glow_mushrooms = cluster of teal bioluminescent mushrooms;
cracked_wall = cracked bark wall block with visible splits, square;
sign = small wooden signpost with arrow board pointing up, no letters.
Style: crisp detailed pixel art, visible square pixels, 1px dark outlines, moss green, bark brown, teal glow, amber and red accents, same pixel scale as a 48px-tall hero.
Composition: one centered object per cell, filling the cell comfortably.
Avoid: text, letters, background, shadows.

